    "title": "MECH.AI: Diagnostic & Repair",
    "description": "This AI-powered app is your ultimate assistant for car repairs, setup, and finding parts. Get step-by-step guidance on DIY repairs, performance tuning, and locating the right parts. Features include detailed tutorials, diagnostic support, and an extensive parts database. Save time and costs, ensuring your vehicle runs smoothly with expert advice. Ideal for both beginners and pros. Begin your car maintenance journey today!",
